WEBVTT

00:07:59.141 --> 00:08:01.685
that learning can take place anywhere.

00:08:02.686 --> 00:08:04.438
And if we do,

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.025
then we decrease the cost of place.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.195
Finally,

00:08:11.195 --> 00:08:13.197
teaching, what about teaching?

00:08:14.031 --> 00:08:16.992
Well, teaching
is at the heart of learning.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.038
Teaching is the inspiration
and the connection.

00:08:21.038 --> 00:08:26.585
It is the spark that connects
the learner to the information.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:31.298
So there's nothing that we want to do
to mess with that magic.